        <!-- Pillar 3 -->
        <mxCell id="p3" value="PILLAR 3: ZERO-TRUST&#xa;Shamir Secret Sharing GF(257)&#xa;&#xa;• Byte-wise Splitting:&#xa;  - f(x) = (s_i + a_1 x) mod 257&#xa;  - (2,3)-Threshold Scheme&#xa;  - Unconditional Secrecy&#xa;• Disjoint Physical Tiers:&#xa;  - Frag 1: Object Header (S3)&#xa;  - Frag 2: Database (SQLite)&#xa;• Lagrange Reconstruction:&#xa;  - Fermat's Inverse Table&#xa;  - Asynchronous Re-keying&#xa;&#xa;[Mapped: Sec 3.5, Sec 4, Sec 8.6]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBF8F4;fontColor=#1E293B;strokeColor=#C98A4B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9.5;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="frame">
